# Prettier 3 already reads .gitignore, so build output is covered. These are the
# tracked files it should still leave alone.

# The product, portfolio, video and equipment data is written by the authoring
# app rather than by hand. Formatting it here would produce a diff every time
# that app regenerates a file, with the formatter and the app rewriting each
# other's output. The .js modules alongside it are hand-written, so they are not
# excluded.
src/data/**/*.json
